check-portability: FAIL tools/loop/labels.sh:97:    status_value="fixed-by": names the project value 'fixed-by' (tools/tooling.json namespaces.status)
check-portability: FAIL tools/loop/worktree.sh:71:    gitw submodule update --init app/src/main/cpp/libosmscout >&2 ||: names the project value 'app/src/main/cpp/libosmscout' (tools/loop/loop.conf LOOP_SUBMODULE_PATH)
check-portability: FAIL tools/issues/resolve-stale.sh:230:      bash "$here/update.sh" "$number" --status on-hold \: names the project value 'on-hold' (tools/tooling.json namespaces.status)
check-portability: FAIL tools/issues/core/TodoAdapter.java:25:        labels.add(profile.label("source", "todo-import"));: names the project value 'todo-import' (tools/tooling.json namespaces.source)
